ul.li:
Smooth row behavior for text and image entries: text rows stay collapsed in-list
and expose a lens button for a large full-text preview overlay inside the popup;
image previews keep a fixed size and centered row actions for stable targeting.

description.p:
- Popup now opens near the focused window;
- Enter or click pastes the selected entry and closes the popup (virtual-keyboard injection, falls back to copy-only when unavailable);
- Clipboard changes are watched via Wayland events instead of polling;
- Toggle uses session D-Bus instead of a polled file, greatly reducing idle CPU;
- Hardened clipboard watcher: bounded transfers, MIME-type fallback, primary-selection cleanup;
- Preview no longer bleeds text behind frosted glass;
- Frosted glass support via dependency updates;
- Polish translation and metainfo improvements;

- Pinned entries now persist after restart;
- Clear History button clears only unpinned entries, pinned entries are preserved;
- Scroll text in text preview using keyboard;
- Performance enhancement;
